        <oboInOwl:hasAlternativeId>GO:0044765</oboInOwl:hasAlternativeId>
        <ns3:IAO_0000115>The directed movement of substances (such as macromolecules, small molecules, ions) or cellular components (such as complexes and organelles) into, out of or within a cell, or between cells, or within a multicellular organism by means of some agent such as a transporter or a transporter complex, a pore or a motor protein.</ns3:IAO_0000115>
